          "pairedMetric": "PPI Inflation",
          "why": "PPI captures inflation pressures at the producer level before they reach the consumer. Reading the two together tells investors whether the consumer inflation is being driven by upstream cost pass-through (sustained) or by domestic demand pressures or one-time effects (potentially transient).",
