          "mechanism": "Health care demand is driven by medical need and demographic forces, and an aging population that lowers participation actually increases health care demand, so the sector benefits from the demographic trends behind falling participation. Its defensive nature also makes it a refuge when participation falls on weakness. The sector benefits from demographic aging.",
