          "mechanism": "The sector is high beta and long duration, so it amplifies the market's direction in both directions and depends most on the marginal buyer. When the cash reserve is exhausted, the sector has the furthest to fall, and when the reserve is large it captures the returning money first. Tech is the purest expression of the contrarian signal.",
